{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"完备Riemann流形"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"完备 Riemann 流形"},2],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"Riemann几何","text":"Riemann 几何"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>完备 Riemann 流形是满足所有测地线都可定义在整个实数轴上的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Riemann流形","text":"Riemann 流形"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>对于连通 Riemann 流形, 其完备等价于作为度量空间的完备, 即每个 Cauchy 序列都收敛.</p>\n"}]}}